(text "V1.5 PILOT: 5V THT REGULATION ONLY, FROM ALREADY PROTECTED EXTERNAL 13.8V SOURCE. 3 ISOLATED RC BRANCHES.\nR611/612/613=1 ohm: rail voltage and transient isolation depend on actual current; LOADS NOT QUALIFIED.\nNo input fuse/TVS/polarity protection designed here. D601 only OUT-to-IN discharge path.\nU601 TO220 tab is GND. Verify thermal at VIN max, true branch load and heatsink. FROM V1.7 F701+D701; NO CONTINUOUS OVP. NO FAB / NO TX." (at 64.77 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2))) (uuid "8c15bcd1-faae-4e37-bf15-000000000153"))
